## Setting Up Generating Functions

For each complex set $S$ with complexity $s$, let $F_S(x) = \sum_{n \geq 1} A_S(n)\,x^n$, where $A_S(n)$ counts expressions of complexity $n$ evaluating to $S$.

The recursion gives:
$$F_S(x) = x^s + \sum_{C_2} F_{[C_2, S]}(x) \cdot F_{C_2}(x)$$

## Key Expansion

